/-!
# Finite retracings preserve the complete increment polygon

The certificate records only concatenation and cancellation of adjacent
opposite edges. No permutation of a word is admitted. Consequently it
preserves both its total and its full cumulative area for every
antisymmetric edge reading, without assuming the path is closed.
-/

namespace Purelib.Topology.Mesh.RetracingWords

open Purelib.Data.List

open Purelib.Data

open Purelib.Integration.Path

open Purelib.Topology.Polygon

open Purelib.Topology.Polygon.Stokes

